e:content-none prose-code:after:content-none"><h3 id=3D"build-apps-and-auto=
mations-that-work-with-the-tools-you-already-use" class=3D"text-2xl font-se=
mibold leading-tight mt-40 mb-20">Build Apps &amp; Automations That Work Wi=
th the Tools You Already Use</h3><p class=3D"hover:prose-a:text-accentBrand=
Lighter mb-24"></p><p class=3D"hover:prose-a:text-accentBrandLighter mb-24"=
>Today, we=E2=80=99re excited to launch <strong>Connectors=E2=80=94a new wa=
y to build apps and automations that seamlessly integrate with the tools yo=
u already rely on every day.</strong></p><p class=3D"hover:prose-a:text-acc=
entBrandLighter mb-24">Connectors make it effortless to extend your applica=
tions with services like Google, Dropbox, Salesforce, Linear, Notion, and m=
ore=E2=80=94without the hassle of managing credentials or reinventing integ=
rations from scratch.</p><figure class=3D"flex flex-col items-center my-16"=
><video src=3D"https://cdn.replit.com/sanity/blog/org-connectors.mp4" loop=
=3D"" muted=3D"" autoplay=3D"" playsinline=3D"" class=3D"w-full rounded-8 b=
order border-outlineDimmest mb-0"></video></figure><p class=3D"hover:prose-=
a:text-accentBrandLighter mb-24"></p><h3 id=3D"why-connectors" class=3D"tex=
t-2xl font-semibold leading-tight mt-40 mb-20">Why Connectors?</h3><p class=
=3D"hover:prose-a:text-accentBrandLighter mb-24">Until now, building apps t=
hat connect to external services has been harder than it should be. Builder=
s and teams had to:</p><ul class=3D"list-disc"><li>Create developer account=
s with each service</li><li>Find and manage credentials</li><li>Wire up int=
egrations </li><li>Repeat this process for every new app or teammate</li></=
ul><p class=3D"hover:prose-a:text-accentBrandLighter mb-24">This was painfu=
l for builders and a headache for IT and admins managing access across orga=
nizations.</p><p class=3D"hover:prose-a:text-accentBrandLighter mb-24"><str=
ong>Connectors change that.</strong></p><p class=3D"hover:prose-a:text-acce=
ntBrandLighter mb-24">Now, all it takes is a simple login. Once you connect=
 a service, your apps can instantly start using it=E2=80=94securely and nat=
ively. You only have to set things up once per service.</p><h3 id=3D"how-it=
-works" class=3D"text-2xl font-semibold leading-tight mt-40 mb-20">How It W=
orks</h3><p class=3D"hover:prose-a:text-accentBrandLighter mb-24">Each Conn=
ector provides the infrastructure you need to work with external apps:</p><=
ul class=3D"list-disc"><li><strong>One-Click Connect</strong>: Log in once,=
 build unlimited applications</li><li><strong>Reliable Integrations</strong=
>: Build with official SDKs following platform conventions</li><li><strong>=
Native Feel</strong>: Every integration behaves like a first-class extensio=
n of your app</li></ul><p class=3D"hover:prose-a:text-accentBrandLighter mb=
-24">For OAuth-based services, there are no credentials to manage. Just aut=
henticate and start building. For API-key-based services, we=E2=80=99ve str=
eamlined the flow to make it just as smooth. We=E2=80=99ve launched first p=
arty support for over 20 connectors with dozens more coming soon. You can s=
ee a list of our supported ones on the <a href=3D"https://replit.com/integr=
ations">integrations page</a>.</p><h3 id=3D"benefits-at-every-level" class=
=3D"text-2xl font-semibold leading-tight mt-40 mb-20">Benefits at Every Lev=
el</h3><h4 id=3D"for-everyone" class=3D"text-xl font-medium leading-snug mt=
-32 mb-16">For Everyone</h4><ul class=3D"list-disc"><li><strong>Faster time=
-to-value</strong>: Build integrated apps in minutes</li><li><strong>Approa=
chable</strong>: Easily connect to and exchange data with external services=
</li><li><strong>Safe by default</strong>: No sensitive credentials to mana=
ge</li><li><strong>Centralized control</strong>: Manage all your connected =
services from a single pane</li><li><strong>Custom integrations</strong>: B=
uild powerful apps using official APIs</li></ul><h4 id=3D"for-enterprise-us=
ers" class=3D"text-xl font-medium leading-snug mt-32 mb-16">For Enterprise =
users</h4><ul class=3D"list-disc"><li><strong>Centralized management</stron=
g>: Control team-wide connections in one place</li><li><strong>Granular acc=
ess</strong>: Enforce role-based permissions and governance</li><li><strong=
>Visibility &amp; auditability</strong>: Track which apps use which service=
s</li><li><strong>Enterprise flexibility</strong>: Bring your own OAuth cli=
ents with custom scopes</li></ul><h3 id=3D"unlocking-new-possibilities" cla=
ss=3D"text-2xl font-semibold leading-tight mt-40 mb-20">Unlocking New Possi=
bilities</h3><p class=3D"hover:prose-a:text-accentBrandLighter mb-24">With =
Connectors, your imagination is the only limit. Here are just a few example=
s across popular services:</p><ul class=3D"list-disc"><li><strong>Google</s=
trong>: A KPI Analyst app that scans Sheets for anomalies and drafts execut=
ive summaries.</li><li><strong>Hubspot</strong>: A Pipeline Risk Radar that=
 flags slippage and suggests next-best actions.</li><li><strong>Atlassian</=
strong>: A Sprint Health Reporter that publishes weekly Confluence updates =
from Jira data.</li><li><strong>Box</strong>: A Contract Renewal Watchdog t=
hat alerts you before agreements expire.</li><li><strong>Discord</strong>: =
A Community Sentiment Summarizer that tracks feedback themes and suggests r=
esponses.</li><li><strong>GitHub</strong>: A PR Review Assistant that check=
s code for correctness, style, and security.</li><li><strong>Notion</strong=
>: A Meeting Notes-to-Actions app that extracts and assigns follow-ups auto=
matically.</li></ul><p class=3D"hover:prose-a:text-accentBrandLighter mb-24=
">And so much more. This is all powered by <a href=3D"https://blog.replit.c=
om/replit-acquires-openint">our recent acquisition of OpenInt</a>.</p><h3 i=
d=3D"looking-forward" class=3D"text-2xl font-semibold leading-tight mt-40 m=
b-20">Looking Forward</h3><p class=3D"hover:prose-a:text-accentBrandLighter=
 mb-24">With Connectors, <strong>building apps that work where you work is =
now easier, faster, and safer</strong>. No more credential wrangling, no mo=
re reinventing the wheel=E2=80=94just log in and start creating apps that f=
eel native to the tools your team already uses. This launch is a major step=
 toward our mission of making software creation more accessible=E2=80=94and=
 more powerful=E2=80=94for everyone.</p><p class=3D"hover:prose-a:text-acce=
ntBrandLighter mb-24">And we=E2=80=99re just getting started. Ahead, we=E2=
=80=99re expanding to new <strong>Connector types (databases &amp; warehous=
es), adding support for webhook events to build more powerful workflows and=
 building a deeper admin experience with permissions, assignments, and anal=
ytics.</strong></p><p class=3D"hover:prose-a:text-accentBrandLighter mb-24"=
></p></div></div></article></div><div class=3D"hidden sm:block h-full grow =
